Hi.

Get Charles Botha's DRI resume patches. I've just begun to use a Radeon
9600, and have successfully suspended and resumed (suspend2) a couple of
times now with SMP (P4), Highmem (1GB) and a Radeon 9600. It is
possible! Just be sure to prepare and install your kernel and its
modules first, then do Charles' install script afterwards.

(I'm not removing any of the related modules prior to suspending).

Regards,

Nigel
